WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.438 --> 00:00:03.838
Lesson eleven. Numbers and Counting!

2
00:00:04.763 --> 00:00:11.880
Hello, hello! Hello, hello! Wave your hand, and say hello! Hello!

3
00:00:12.869 --> 00:00:14.617
Coco, what do we learn today?

4
00:00:14.667 --> 00:00:18.342
Today we learn: Numbers and Counting! Let's go!

5
00:00:19.756 --> 00:00:23.273
Eleven! Say it with me. Eleven!

6
00:00:27.219 --> 00:00:30.685
Twelve! Say it with me. Twelve!

7
00:00:34.679 --> 00:00:38.245
Twenty! Say it with me. Twenty!

8
00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:45.667
Hundred! Say it with me. Hundred!

9
00:00:49.698 --> 00:00:53.198
Add! Say it with me. Add!

10
00:00:57.194 --> 00:01:00.828
Subtract! Say it with me. Subtract!

11
00:01:04.809 --> 00:01:07.975
Count! Say it with me. Count!

12
00:01:12.024 --> 00:01:15.607
Number! Say it with me. Number!

13
00:01:19.603 --> 00:01:25.089
Listen. Eleven, twelve... twenty.

14
00:01:25.139 --> 00:01:28.797
Say it with me. Eleven, twelve... twenty.

15
00:01:33.574 --> 00:01:40.501
We can count past twelve, all the way to twenty and even a hundred. Let's add and subtract numbers.

16
00:01:40.551 --> 00:01:41.967
I like this story!

17
00:01:42.794 --> 00:01:48.081
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:48.131 --> 00:01:49.281
Twenty!

19
00:01:50.240 --> 00:01:55.553
Look! What's the word?

20
00:01:55.603 --> 00:01:56.753
Subtract!

21
00:01:57.852 --> 00:02:03.644
Value corner: Friendship. Good friends care about each other and have fun together.

22
00:02:03.694 --> 00:02:05.417
I can show friendship too!

23
00:02:06.195 --> 00:02:13.473
Bye-bye, bye-bye! See you soon! Wave your hand. Bye-bye, bye-bye!

24
00:02:13.523 --> 00:02:15.183
Bye-bye, friends!

